  "description": "Damp proofing and plastering works at Lower Ground Floor. The installation of a heat recovery extract fan to the kitchen and passive vents to habitable rooms at Lower Ground Floor. Electrical and plumbing replacement works. Replacement of the existing kitchen units and appliances in existing locations, the replacement of bathroom sanitaryware in existing locations .The redecoration internally throughout. Replacement of floor coverings. Door replacement at lower ground floor level and other minor joinery repairs including the reconstruction of existing built in cupboards at Lower Ground Floor. Reduction of external ground level to the rear courtyard and extension of the surface water french drain.  Installation of metal gate to vault entrance. Removal of paint from external walls and repainting with a breathable paint.\n",
